# Mira / MET Jira Ops

- Independent repo on branch `main`; service `met-jira-ops.service`, default port 8803.
- Never import MET Jira application code. Configure via `configs/ops.env` and environment overrides (`METJIRA_OPS_*`).
- Reads presence under `~/.met_jira_ops/presence` and queries production/staging databases read-only (`met_jira_ops` role).
- After code changes: `systemctl --user restart met-jira-ops.service`.
